Uses no river DOC
  DOC_RIV_FLUX : never_average
  DOCr_RIV_FLUX : never_average

sed -i \
  -e 's/^[[:space:]]*DOC_RIV_FLUX[[:space:]]*:.*$/DOC_RIV_FLUX : never_average/' \
  -e 's/^[[:space:]]*DOCr_RIV_FLUX[[:space:]]*:.*$/DOCr_RIV_FLUX : never_average/' \
  SourceMods/src.pop/ecosys_diagnostics


modify ecosys_forcing_mod.F90 to turn off DOC and DOCr from rivers



ecosys_forcing_mod.F90
        ↓
changes whether/how river DOC enters the model

ecosys_diagnostics
        ↓
changes whether DOC_RIV_FLUX and DOCr_RIV_FLUX are averaged/output



